description: Accessibility and markup rules for the web app
globs: apps/web/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Accessibility/UI

- Semantic HTML first. ARIA/keyboard only if native insufficient.
- No default `tabindex`/`role`/`aria-*` on natively-working elements.
- No wrapper `div`/`span` around a single child — use the semantic/interactive element directly, or flex/grid on the parent.
